AIWorker CLI Commands - Phase 2 Integration

Rich-based CLI for interactive control and monitoring:
- status: Live status table with memory bar
- logs: Follow log file (tail -f style)
- approve: Interactive patch review
- reject: Reject patch with reason
- reset-kill-switch: Emergency recovery
- run-now: Trigger immediate iteration
- config: View/edit configuration

Example output:
┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ AIWorker Status                         │
├─────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ State: VALIDATE                         │
│ Iteration: iter_20260327_143022_8932    │
│ Duration: 12m 34s                       │
│ Progress: [████████░░░░░░░░░░░░] 40%    │
│ Memory: [████████████████░░░░░░░░] 24GB │
│ Pending Approvals: 1                    │
└─────────────────────────────────────────┘
"""

